n**v4.8.dev4** + Game View: ON or OFF: No issue.\n\n**v4.8-beta1**:\n  -Game View: ON: No issue.\n  -Game View: OFF: **reproducible** every time by clicking a node in Remote Tree; (the game freezes ~0.5 seconds then crashes, but the Editor is unaffected).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6231609745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6232576634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124488#issuecomment-6232576634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124488","id":6232576634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABc32Seg","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:01:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:14:09Z","body":"Also can reproduce with Game View disabled. Seems like the whole remote inspection now depends on the Game View through `\"scene:runtime_node_select_setup\"`. Edit: Separate window with Game View enabled works fine tho.\n\nThe call stack from attached to the process debugger:\n> Stop reason: signal SIGSEGV: address not mapped to object (fault address=0x188)\n\n```\nCanvasItemManipulator::reset_temp_pivot() (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/scene/debugger/canvas_item_manipulator.cpp:2243)\nRuntimeNodeSelect::_set_selected_nodes(Vector<Node*> const&) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/scene/debugger/runtime_node_select.cpp:918)\nSceneDebugger::_send_object_ids(Vector<ObjectID> const&, bool) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp:832)\nSceneDebugger::_msg_inspect_objects(Array const&) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp:239)\nSceneDebugger::parse_message(void*, String const&, Array const&, bool&) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp:689)\nEngineDebugger::capture_parse(StringName const&, String const&, Array const&, bool&) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/core/debugger/engine_debugger.cpp:104)\nRemoteDebugger::poll_events(bool) (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/core/debugger/remote_debugger.cpp:686)\nMain::iteration() (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/main/main.cpp:5146)\nOS_LinuxBSD::run() (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/platform/linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp:1026)\nmain (/mnt/Data/Projects/Godot/godot/platform/linuxbsd/godot_linuxbsd.cpp:122)\n___lldb_unnamed_symbol_27700 (@___lldb_unnamed_symbol_27700:27)\n__libc_start_main (@__libc_start_main:44)\n_start (@_start:15)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6232576634/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6232732137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124488#issuecom